# A full copy of each run's final working directory is captured as raw
# evidence for debugging, but it's a scratch git repo (has its own .git)
# and git refuses to track a nested repo cleanly (embedded-repo warning).
# The load-bearing evidence — the per-run result JSON, the NDJSON
# transcript, stdout/stderr, the agent's own text, the keel install log,
# and the trace summary — lives one level up in the same raw/<run>/
# directory and IS tracked.
results/raw/*/final-workdir/
